    "difficulty": "High clearance 4x4.",
    "elevation": "About 5,500–6,500 ft",
    "fee": "BLM designated route.",
    "access": "From the Swell road network west of Green River. I-70 gets you to the region, not into the canyon.",
    "tips": [
      "Do not drive the canyon with storms on the reef.",
      "The bridge is not a trailhead you can walk down from the freeway."
    ],
    "watch": "Floods and rock.",
