    "lat": 38.9459,
    "lng": -110.49489,
    "area": "San Rafael Swell, near I-70",
    "signature": "A short canyon with a pictograph panel.",
    "summary": "Black Dragon Canyon is an easy Swell stop off I-70, a dirt road to a rock-art panel. It is not a hard trail. It is included because people drive past it for years.",
    "why": "The panel is the reason. The road is how you do not have to hike all day to see it.",
