    "difficulty": "Usually a careful passenger car or stock SUV. The road is dirt and can rut.",
    "elevation": "About 6,000 ft",
    "fee": "BLM. Do not touch the panel. Do not make a rubbing. Do not chalk it.",
    "access": "Off I-70 in the Swell, signed well enough if you are looking.",
    "tips": [
      "This is a fragile panel next to a freeway. Act like the freeway is not there.",
      "It is a bad place to test a crawler. Wrong canyon."
    ],
