    "best": "Year-round, with summer heat and winter closures after storms. The road is sometimes gated.",
    "time": "2.3 miles · 1–2 hours",
    "difficulty": "High clearance. Very rocky for its length.",
    "elevation": "About 4,500 ft",
    "fee": "Coconino National Forest. A permit or a gate schedule may apply. Do not drive around a gate. The wilderness boundary is the end of the vehicle.",
