    "area": "North of Phoenix, off I-17",
    "signature": "The closest big OHV area to Phoenix.",
    "summary": "Table Mesa is the heavily used off-road area just off I-17 north of Phoenix: a network of desert tracks on the mesa and in the washes. The mapped roads are the named Table Mesa routes, not every spur people have cut.",
    "why": "It is where the city goes. Expect company, and expect the desert to look tired on Sunday night.",
