    "area": "Above Ouray",
    "signature": "A basin of wildflowers at the end of a mining road.",
    "summary": "Yankee Boy Basin Road climbs out of Ouray into a high basin under Mount Sneffels. The lower road passes waterfalls. The upper road is a 4x4 shelf into the basin. In July the flowers are the point. The shelf is the price.",
