    "area": "Between Rollinsville and Winter Park",
    "signature": "The old railroad grade over the Continental Divide.",
    "summary": "Rollins Pass Road follows the grade of the old Denver, Northwestern & Pacific toward the Needle's Eye tunnel, which collapsed and closed the through-route. You can still drive the east side, a shelf of a railroad grade with no rails, up to the closure.",
